  storyText: "PATIENT: Cassandra Bouchat\nDATE: June 3/1981\n\nIt has been 6 weeks
    since Cassandra started taking her medication. She has gained some weight, however,
    she is generally far more relaxed and stable. It also seems like things are going
    well with her husband. They started attending a weekly painting class together.
    I'm glad that the treatment is starting to show some improvements...\n\t\t>>1.
    BACK"
